{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34244","headline":"奉和袭美酒中十咏 酒乡 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美酒中十咏 酒乡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁知此中路，暗出虚无际。\n广莫是邻封，华胥爲附丽。\n三杯闻古乐，伯雅逢遗裔。\n自尔等荣枯，何劳问玄弟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}